get works where date <= (2019-06-30) and title-abstract-keywords has ((depress* OR affective) AND (prospective OR longitud* OR predict* OR onset OR relaps* OR recurr* OR remiss* OR risk OR vulnerab*) AND (neuroimag* OR MRI OR fMRI OR EEG OR DTI OR MEG OR PET OR SPECT OR "brain imaging" OR microbi* OR gut OR fecal OR prebiotic OR probiotic OR CRP OR "C-reactive protein" OR cytokine* OR interleukin* OR inflamm* OR immune OR BDNF OR neurotroph* OR "growth factor" OR "growth protein" OR serotonin OR dopamine OR norepinephrine OR noradrenalin OR "gamma-aminobutyric acid" OR glutamat* OR acetylcholin* OR choliner* OR hormon* OR steroid* OR cortisol OR corticotropin OR estrad* OR estron* OR estrogen OR oestrogen OR oestrad* OR progest* OR prolact* OR androgen* OR testost* OR dehydroepiandrosterone OR DHEA OR gonadotrop* OR FSH OR LH OR ACTH OR thyroid OR thyroxine OR TRH OR TSH OR insulin OR leptin OR melatonin OR cholesterol OR "oxidative stress" OR "reactive oxygen species" OR "free radicals" OR "nitric oxide" OR "lipid peroxidation" OR malondialdehyde OR glutathione OR deoxyguanosine OR isoprostane* OR prostaglandin* OR biomarker*))
